      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1614,
      "text": "They brought his shirt, stained with false blood[6]. He said, “Nay; rather your souls have enticed you to commit something. But I will bear it with beautiful patience. It is Allah’s help that I seek against what you claim.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 12,
